Hello group,

I am using the sameness effect to see whether industrial firms and financial
firms have moved apart in the Dutch interlocking directorates. All is
working well, however, is there a way to see what group contributed the most
to the sameness effect? Sameness shows overall whether actors (firms) have a
preference for alters with the exact same value, but it seems unclear which
group contributes the most to the effect.

Thanks.

Kind regards,

Ferdi
